### Send Message to Channel
POST http://localhost:5000/api/message/channel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Hello everyone!",
  "channelId": "64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60010",
  "fileUrl": "",
  "fileName": ""
}

### Send Message with File to Channel
POST http://localhost:5000/api/message/channel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Check this file",
  "channelId": "64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60010",
  "fileUrl": "/uploads/1700000000000-document.pdf",
  "fileName": "document.pdf"
}

### Get Channel Messages (Default Page 1)
# Replace :channelId with actual channel ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/messages/channel/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60010
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Channel Messages (Page 2)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/messages/channel/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60010?page=2&limit=30
Content-Type: application/json

### Edit Message
# Replace :id with actual message ID
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/message/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60020
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Hello everyone! (edited)"
}

### Delete Message (Soft Delete)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/message/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60020
Content-Type: application/json

### Add Reaction to Message
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/message/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60020/react
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "emoji": "👍"
}

### Add Another Reaction
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/message/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60020/react
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emoji": "❤️"
}

### Toggle Off Reaction (Same emoji removes it)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/message/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60020/react
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emoji": "👍"
}

### Create Thread Reply
# Replace :id with parent message ID
POST http://localhost:5000/api/message/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60020/thread
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "This is a thread reply",
  "channelId": "64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60010"
}

### Send Another Thread Reply
POST http://localhost:5000/api/message/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60020/thread
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Another reply in thread",
  "channelId": "64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60010"
}

### Get Thread Replies
GET http://localhost:5000/api/message/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60020/thread
Content-Type: application/json